sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant UI as Web UI
    participant API as Backend Server
    participant DB as Database
    participant Poller as Python Pollers
    participant External as External Data APIs

    Note over Poller,External: Background content collection
    Poller->>External: Request latest news, sports, and stock data
    External-->>Poller: Return source information
    Poller->>DB: Store collected content

    Note over User,DB: User opens the application
    User->>UI: Open daily highlights
    UI->>API: Request personalized stories
    API->>DB: Retrieve user preferences
    DB-->>API: Return selected categories and order
    API->>DB: Retrieve relevant content
    DB-->>API: Return available stories
    API->>API: Filter and order stories by preferences
    API-->>UI: Return personalized story sequence
    UI-->>User: Display first story

    loop Until the user finishes browsing
        User->>UI: Swipe to next story
        UI-->>User: Display next story
    end